    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 9th level, a symbiat’s evasion ability improves. He still takes no damage on a successful Reflex saving throw against attacks, but henceforth he takes only half damage on a failed save. A helpless symbiat does not gain the benefit of improved evasion.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/symbiat#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
